        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen, front profile solid wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen, front profile solid wood, at plant
na;
UUID: ffaed20e-f741-3998-8a8b-b20959b7edd4
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards and the front cover (solid wood, 16 mm the basic structure and 19 mm the front covers). Screws and hinges are considered. The countertop is not included. Sink, cooker hood and waste system are included. The kitchen cupboards have an usable volume of 3.36 m3.  The area of front cover is 8.9 m2. Linked to updated LCI of particle boards from Ecoinvent data v3.2 for KBOB recommendation 2016.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ffaed20e-f741-3998-8a8b-b20959b7edd4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
